#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: msc-post-expiry.php includes/class-mscpe-settings.php:66
#: includes/class-mscpe-settings.php:67 includes/class-mscpe-settings.php:220
msgid "MSC Post Expiry"
msgstr "MSC Post Expiry"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: msc-post-expiry.php
msgid "https://github.com/djm56/msc-post-expiry"
msgstr "https://github.com/djm56/msc-post-expiry"

#. Description of the plugin
#: msc-post-expiry.php
msgid ""
"Automatically expire posts and pages on a scheduled date. Set expiration "
"dates in the post editor and let the plugin handle the rest."
msgstr ""
"Автоматически истекайте записи и страницы в запланированную дату. Установите"
" даты истечения в редакторе записи, а остальное плагин сделает сам."

#. Author of the plugin
